{"script":"sj_026_03","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara026_1_face_chara026_1c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":264.5,"y":-173,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara026_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara026_1_face_chara026_1c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":264.5,"transTime":300,"y":-173,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara026_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"贝拉多娜","text":"[show]你你你在说什么啊，{myName}？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贝拉多娜","text":"[show]本小姐一直都很厉害！难道赤血剑姬的称号是白来的吗？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara026_1_face_chara026_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"贝拉多娜","text":"[show]等等……为什么突然说这种大实话？难道开窍了？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara026_1_face_chara026_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"贝拉多娜","text":"[show]看在本小姐心情不错的份上，说吧，你想拜托本小姐帮什么忙？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara026_1_face_chara026_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"贝拉多娜","text":"[show]什么……原来只是在关注本小姐？贵、贵族就是容易吸引人的注意，这也是没办法的事！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara026_1_face_chara026_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"贝拉多娜","text":"[show]我才、才没有傻笑，这是自豪！本小姐的剑术只会变得更强，强到有一日让{myName}和那头臭狼狗都望尘莫及！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara026_1_face_chara026_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"贝拉多娜","text":"[show]赤血剑术……是希斯珀利亚家族祖传的剑术。复兴家族之事任重道远……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贝拉多娜","text":"[show]本小姐唯一能做的，就是用赤血剑姬的名号让所有人都记住希斯珀利亚家。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara026_1_face_chara026_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"贝拉多娜","text":"[show]他们也一定会夸赞本小姐的聪慧！本小姐成为女伯爵的日子不远了！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贝拉多娜","text":"[show]{myName}也好，臭狼狗也是，不努力的话，就要被本小姐甩得远远的了哦！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara026_1_face_chara026_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"贝拉多娜","text":"[show]一起加油……？也……也不是不行啦……！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"剑术比以前更精湛了呢"}